# K1 robot soccer: deploy first

This repo trains Booster K1 football skills for the **real robot**, run by
`../k1_policy_runner` (ONNX, 50 Hz).

1. Read `knowledge/INDEX.md` before working; objectives and standing decisions
   are in `knowledge/objectives.md` (ask before changing them).
2. What a policy observes or outputs is the deployment contract
   (`knowledge/deployment.md`). Changing it is a runtime change: note the
   matching runner change, pass parity, say so in the commit. Do not edit
   `../k1_policy_runner` from this repo's work.
3. Run the safety net in `tests/golden/README.md` before and after code changes.
4. One change per run, judged against a same-length control on the task's
   benchmark, never on training curves.
